# Cargo build output. Unanchored so the pattern catches both the
# client crate's `target/` at the repo root and the sibling
# `ws2_32-proxy/target/` produced by the Windows cross-compile
# (`cargo build --target i686-pc-windows-gnu`). Committing the DLL
# artifacts would bloat the repo and stale quickly; future
# contributors rebuild locally following README instructions.
target/

# Editor backup files Rust tooling sometimes leaves behind.
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
.DS_Store
/.cargo

# Stray intermediate `.def` files from in-place ordinal edits.
# `ws2_32-proxy/ws2_32.def` itself is tracked.
**/*.def.new
**/*.def.bak
